    "summary": "Cancel a payment request",
    "description": "Cancel a request that has not been paid: its PaymentIntent is\ncanceled (in subscription mode, the first-period invoice is voided and\nthe incomplete Subscription canceled), the request moves to\n`canceled`, every card that carries it changes in place, and your\nagent gets `payment.canceled`. A request that is already `succeeded`,\n`canceled` or `expired`, or that was paid before the cancel reached\nStripe, returns 409.\n",
